;
; MoveFiles Config file
;
; This config files must contain the source & destination DirX text filenames,
; the source upload dir path, and destination archive path, and the nr of days
; of wares you want to keep (if the wares are older than that number, the files
; will be moved from the source upload path to the destination archive path.
; In addition, the DirX text files will be updated accordingly.
;
; SAMPLE CONFIG OPTIONS (you must have ALL five)
;
; NR_DAYS_OLD   30
; SRC_DIR_TXT   BBS:Elite/Dir2
; SRC_PATH      BBS:Elite/Upload
; DEST_DIR_TXT  BBS:Elite/Dir1
; DEST_PATH     BAK:Elitefiles
;
; ACTUAL CONFIG OPTIONS [[[[ YOU must set these! ]]]
;
NR_DAYS_OLD   90
SRC_DIR_TXT   RAM:Dir2
SRC_PATH      BBS:Main/Upload
DEST_DIR_TXT  RAM:Dir1
DEST_PATH     BAK:
